      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({application=\"epricing-service\", level=\"WARN\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "WARN logs",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "**Total `WARN` Log Events in Selected Time Window (Loki)**\n\nCounts warning logs in Loki matching `{application=\"epricing-service\", level=\"WARN\"}` over `$__range`.\n\n- **Typical causes:** Business rejections (`PRICING_REJECTED` when credit score `< 650` or `FOIR > 50%`), Bean Validation failures (`VALIDATION_FAILURE`), slow operations (`> 200ms` DB / `> 500ms` op), or `/metrics-demo/simulate-slow`.\n- **Green:** `0` | **Yellow:** `≥ 1`"
    },
