      "description": "**Total `INFO` Log Events in Selected Time Window (Loki)**\n\nCounts informational structured logs (`PRICING_STARTED`, `PRICING_COMPLETED`, `MDCFilter` ingress/exit, Kafka publish confirmations) in Loki over `$__range`.\n\n- **Health signal:** `0` while traffic is running indicates Promtail log shipping or `/app/logs` volume ingestion stalled."
