      "description": "**Simulated Observability Drill Errors (Cumulative)**\n\nTracks `pricing_demo_errors_total{error_type=\"SIMULATED_ERROR\"}`, emitted strictly by `GET /api/v1/metrics-demo/simulate-error` (`MetricsDemoController`, inactive in `prod`). Kept separate from `pricing_errors_total` so test drills never poison real production error alerts.\n\n- **Yellow:** `≥ 1` (expected periodically when `traffic-generator` runs step `mod 25`)."
    },
