    {
      "id": 41,
      "title": "All Error Types (Cumulative)",
      "description": "**Cumulative Pricing Exceptions by Machine Error Code (Prometheus)**\n\nBreaks down `pricing_errors_total` by `error_type` label (`GlobalExceptionHandler`):\n- `PRICING_INSUFFICIENT_CREDIT_SCORE` / `PRICING_FOIR_EXCEEDED` / `PRICING_AMOUNT_EXCEEDS_ELIGIBILITY` (`422`)\n- `VALIDATION_FAILED` / `TEMPORAL_DISABLED` (`400`)\n- `PRICING_CALCULATION_FAILED` / `UNHANDLED_*` (`500`).",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (error_type) (pricing_errors_total{application=\"epricing-service\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{error_type}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "title": "Error Rate Over Time",
      "description": "**Pricing Exception Rate Over Time (`errors/sec` by `error_type`)**\n\n1-minute rolling rate (`rate(pricing_errors_total[1m])`) split by `error_type` so you can see immediately whether a spike comes from client `422` underwriting rejections or `500` server exceptions.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 7,
        "y": 12
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-uid"
      },
      "options": {
